{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22465","headline":"东坡种花二首 一 · 白居易","name":"东坡种花二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"持钱买花树，城东坡上栽。\n但购有花者，不限桃杏梅。\n百果参杂种，千枝次第开。\n天时有早晚，地力无高低。\n红者霞艳艳，白者雪皑皑。\n游蠭逐不去，好鸟亦来栖。\n前有长流水，下有小平台。\n时拂台上石，一举风前杯。\n花枝荫我头，花蘂落我怀。\n独酌复独咏，不觉月平西。\n巴俗不爱花，竟春无人来。\n唯此醉太守，尽日不能回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}